# A three-seat couch facing the room. Staff sit on it, feet on the floor in
# front, so it paints under them (zbias -1). Two pillows for when it is empty.
sprite break-couch
size 48 28
layer object
footprint 3 1
origin 0 12
zbias -1
tag couch seat rest
spot seat-0 0 0 down rest sit
spot seat-1 1 0 down rest sit
spot seat-2 2 0 down rest sit
variant teal r=t R=T 8=6 t=r T=R
variant sage r=s R=S 8=0

frame default
